    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d39">

                <pb facs="0134" n="60" sameAs="frus:frus1866p1/pg60"/>

                <head>Mr. Adams to Mr.
                        Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1138.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States</hi>,
                                <hi rendition="#italic">London,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-01-26"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 26, 1866.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> In connection with my despatch No. 1129, of
                    the 5th instant, reporting to you my note to Lord Clarendon relative to the
                    deposition of Temple, I have now to transmit a copy of his lordship’s commentary
                    on that deposition, dated the 19th instant, and also of my reply.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>CHARLES FRANCIS ADAMS.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hon. William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, Washington, D. C.</hi></p>
                </postscript>



                <xi:include href="d39-a1.xml" xpointer="d39-a1"/>
